# Files that belong to the repository, not to the documentation site.
# They are read on GitHub, where they keep their own format.
# A pattern with a leading slash matches the root of the repository only.

# The landing page of the site replaces the readme.
/README.md

# The project files: the wiki changelog and the links of the landing page
# point to them on GitHub.
/CHANGELOG.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/SECURITY.md
/SPEC.md
/SUPPORT.md
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md

# The sidebar and the footer of the GitHub wiki.
/wiki/_Sidebar.md
/wiki/_Footer.md

# The home of the wiki: the landing page of the site replaces it.
/wiki/Home.md
